#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/access.py:7
msgid "接入流程管理 -- TXS-10002-2025 标准 7.1.3。"
msgstr "Access procedure management — TXS-10002-2025 standard section 7.1.3."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/access.py:9
msgid ""
"实现 SLE 设备发现和接入的完整六阶段流程:   a) 广播方准备并发送可接入扩展广播帧   b) 接入发起方发送接入请求帧   c) "
"广播方接收请求并发送响应   d) 接入方接收响应并进入链接态   e) 数据链路建立   f) 安全流程 (委托给 security 模块)"
msgstr ""
"Implement the complete six-stage SLE device discovery and access process:"
"   a) Broadcaster prepares and sends an accessible extended advertising "
"frame   b) Access initiator sends an access request frame   c) "
"Broadcaster receives the request and sends a response   d) Accessor "
"receives the response and enters connected state   e) Data link "
"establishment   f) Security process (delegated to the security module)"

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/access.py:17
msgid ""
"协调 BroadcastFrame、AccessBasicInfo、TransportIndicationInfo、 "
"AccessRequestInfo、AccessResponseInfo 等数据结构完成端到端接入。"
msgstr ""
"Coordinate data structures such as BroadcastFrame, AccessBasicInfo, "
"TransportIndicationInfo, AccessRequestInfo, and AccessResponseInfo to "
"complete end-to-end access."

