#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/access.py:487
msgid ""
"实现发现设备接收广播帧后的查询请求/响应流程:   a) 广播设备发送基础广播帧和扩展广播帧   b) "
"发现设备收到可查询扩展广播帧后发送查询请求帧   c) 广播设备接收请求并发送查询响应帧   d) 发现设备接收查询响应帧, 完成发现"
msgstr ""
"Implement the inquiry request/response process after a discovering device"
" receives a broadcast frame:   a) Broadcasting device sends basic and "
"extended advertising frames   b) Discovering device sends an inquiry "
"request frame after receiving a queryable extended advertising frame   c)"
" Broadcasting device receives the request and sends an inquiry response "
"frame   d) Discovering device receives the inquiry response frame, "
"completing discovery"

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/access.py:536
msgid "处理收到的广播帧。"
msgstr "Process a received broadcast frame."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/mac/access.py:538
msgid "若帧中包含发现/接入资源配置且为可查询帧, 返回 True 表示可发送查询请求。 白名单启用时仅处理白名单内设备。"
msgstr ""
"If the frame contains discovery/access resource configuration and is a "
"queryable frame, return True indicating an inquiry request can be sent. "
"Only process whitelisted devices when the whitelist is enabled."

